// Test Input statement implementation
Disp "Input Test Program"
Disp "=================="

// Test 1: Simple input with prompt
Input("Enter your name: ", name)
Disp "Hello, "
Disp name

// Test 2: Input with another prompt
Input("Enter age: ", age)
Disp "Age entered: "
Disp age

// Test 3: Multiple inputs
Input("First: ", str1)
Input("Second: ", str2)
Disp "You entered:"
Disp str1
Disp str2

Pause
